# For the VS Code REST Client, Rider or Visual Studio. Start the API with `dotnet run --launch-profile http`.
@host = http://localhost:5038
@email = local.dev@example.com
@password = correct horse battery staple

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firstName": "Local", "lastName": "Dev", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Sign in, then paste "accessToken" into @token below (valid for 15 minutes)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}", "installId": "http-file-install-0001", "platform": "ios", "appVersion": "dev" }

###
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Profile
GET {{host}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Signed-in devices
GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Gallery
GET {{host}}/api/v1/artworks?page=1&pageSize=12
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Generation in progress (204 if none)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/generations/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
